{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 38,
  "title": "Passage 38",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s38-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p01.mp3",
      "en": "We know many musical instruments well, such as pianos, violins, drums, and so on.",
      "cn": "我们对许多乐器都很熟悉，如钢琴、小提琴、鼓等。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s38-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p02.mp3",
      "en": "What about the erhu?",
      "cn": "那么二胡呢？"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s38-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p03.mp3",
      "en": "The erhu is a traditional Chinese instrument.",
      "cn": "二胡是中国的传统乐器。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s38-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p04.mp3",
      "en": "It is different from Western string instruments because it has no board to hold the strings down.",
      "cn": "它不同于西方的弦乐器，因为它没有供手指按弦的指板。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s38-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p05.mp3",
      "en": "The player puts it on the knee while moving the bow to create sound.",
      "cn": "演奏者将其放在膝盖上，同时拉动琴弓来发声。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s38-p06-01",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p06-01.mp3",
      "en": "If you learn to play erhu,",
      "cn": "如果你想学习二胡，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s38-p06-02",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p06-02.mp3",
      "en": "you have to know where the notes are on the strings,",
      "cn": "你必须知道音符在琴弦上的位置，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s38-p06-03",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p06-03.mp3",
      "en": "which is similar to English learning,",
      "cn": "这与学习英语类似，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s38-p06-04",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p06-04.mp3",
      "en": "where one has to spell and pronounce the words right in the first place.",
      "cn": "你得先把单词拼对、读准。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s38-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p07.mp3",
      "en": "The modern erhu developed from the xiqin, played by many ethnic minorities during the Tang Dynasty.",
      "cn": "现代二胡是从唐代许多少数民族演奏的奚琴演变而来的。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s38-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p08.mp3",
      "en": "In the Song Dynasty, musicians used the erhu to perform different kinds of music.",
      "cn": "在宋代，乐师们用二胡演奏不同类型的乐曲。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s38-p09-01",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p09-01.mp3",
      "en": "With the rise of some forms of folk art,",
      "cn": "随着一些民间艺术形式的兴起，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s38-p09-02",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p09-02.mp3",
      "en": "the art of the erhu developed quickly during the Ming and Qing Dynasties.",
      "cn": "二胡艺术在明清时期迅速发展。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s38-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p10.mp3",
      "en": "At present, it is used in both traditional and modern music, such as in pop, rock and jazz.",
      "cn": "目前，二胡不仅用于传统音乐，而且也用于现代音乐，如流行乐、摇滚乐和爵士乐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s38-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p11.mp3",
      "en": "One of the most famous musical pieces played on the erhu is Erquan Yingyue, first played by a blind musician.",
      "cn": "最著名的二胡曲目之一是《二泉映月》，这首曲子最初是由一位盲人音乐家演奏的。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s38-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p12.mp3",
      "en": "You can now hear the erhu in some popular historical dramas.",
      "cn": "现在，你可以在一些热门历史剧中听到二胡的声音。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s38-p13-01",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p13-01.mp3",
      "en": "As the erhu was mainly played by common people and the playing skills were passed down orally from father to son,",
      "cn": "由于二胡主要由普通百姓演奏，演奏技巧也是从父亲到儿子口头传授的，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s38-p13-02",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p13-02.mp3",
      "en": "there are few written records about the erhu that can be found.",
      "cn": "因此，能够找到的有关二胡的文字记载很少。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 19,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s38-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p14.mp3",
      "en": "To study the history and the development of the erhu, historians usually turn to ancient paintings.",
      "cn": "为了研究二胡的历史和发展，历史学家通常会参考古代绘画作品。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 20,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s38-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s38-p15.mp3",
      "en": "In Yulin Caves and Eastern Thousand Buddha Caves in Gansu Province, five erhu pictures were discovered on murals.",
      "cn": "在甘肃省的榆林窟和东千佛洞中的壁画上，就发现了五幅二胡图画。"
    }
  ],
